      "type": "explain",
      "q": "Why can RSA-3072 OAEP-SHA256 not encrypt a 1 KB file?",
      "a": "OAEP limits the message to 384 - 64 - 2 = 318 bytes.",
      "anchor": "#asymmetric-cryptography-mechanism",
      "origin": "ai"
